                  <provenance type="#l"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_133">Chertsey, Surrey.
                        Benedictine abbey of St Peter. </orgName><p>Provenance inferred from
                        calendar-entries, etc. See F. Wormald, English Benedictine Kalendars before
                        a.d. 1100, 1 Henry Bradshaw Soc. (1938), 81.</p><p>This manuscript comprises
                        ten leaves: fols. 221--225, 306--308, 277(?), and 34 and 10 (from the
                        sanctorale) of a breviary; the foliation is comparatively recent. 2 cols. of
                        32 lines.</p><p>Bodl. Lat. liturg. d.42, e.6, e.37 and e.39 are portions of
                        one manuscript; see BLR 9 (1974) 72--4, 78--80.</p></provenance>
